{"id":1294189,"imdb":"tt13611778","en":"The Mongoose","orig":"The Mongoose","ar":"النمس","tag":null,"ov":"يجد ريان «فانغ» فلاناغان، وهو محارب سابق، نفسه متهمًا بجريمة قتل لم يرتكبها، فيضطر إلى الهرب من الشرطة والانطلاق في مطاردة سيارات طويلة عبر البلاد. وبينما يساعده بعض رفاقه السابقين في القوات الخاصة، تتحول المطاردة إلى حدث يُبث مباشرة على الهواء، فيتعاطف الجمهور معه ويبدأ بتشجيعه، في حين تواصل السلطات ملاحقته ومحاولة القبض عليه وكشف الحقيقة وراء الاتهام.","rd":"2026-10-29","rt":99,"g":[28,53],"lang":"en","budget":0,"revenue":0,"companies":[{"n":"Code Entertainment","logo":"/5WrEKsyGdTfT3T075EukSoIuxSU.png","c":"US"},{"n":"The Solution","logo":"/f8TDXTNoj4G4eRCKlUpG3KYQj9I.png","c":"US"}],"countries":["AU"],"langs":[],"col":null,"rel":[{"c":"AE","d":"2026-10-29"},{"c":"BH","d":"2026-10-29"},{"c":"KW","d":"2026-10-29"},{"c":"OM","d":"2026-10-29"},{"c":"QA","d":"2026-10-29"},{"c":"SG","d":"2026-10-29"},{"c":"TW","d":"2026-10-30"},{"c":"US","d":"2026-10-30"},{"c":"BR","d":"2026-11-04"},{"c":"DE","d":"2026-11-04"},{"c":"FR","d":"2026-11-04"},{"c":"RO","d":"2026-11-04"},{"c":"TR","d":"2026-11-04"},{"c":"GR","d":"2026-11-05"},{"c":"IL","d":"2026-11-12"},{"c":"UA","d":"2026-12-10"}],"dir":["Mark Vanselow"],"prod":["Al Corley","Eugene Musso","Bart Rosenblatt"],"wri":["Thompson Evans"],"mus":["Michael Yezerski"],"dop":["Tom Stern"],"cast":[{"n":"Liam Neeson","ch":"Ryan 'Fang' Flanagan","p":"/sRLev3wJioBgun3ZoeAUFpkLy0D.jpg"},{"n":"Marisa Tomei","ch":"Tara","p":"/5NCCKQooVCQD36R6JL3a1hOeBVn.jpg"},{"n":"Ving Rhames","ch":"Tanker","p":"/tOVDvu1EQP78AwaUw6uh1wN818E.jpg"},{"n":"Marcus Thomas","ch":"Munch","p":"/wpsm5roIsSqaOX9ApIJqCxDAqgD.jpg"},{"n":"Michael Chiklis","ch":"Major Walter Pope","p":"/pAkKjbzxP6Z6Y5zAGpwmWQo1iji.jpg"},{"n":"Maurice Marvel Meredith","ch":"Major James Tilton","p":"/kM7vENDYHJQRhZh83F8IRCznIXP.jpg"},{"n":"Brett Tucker","ch":"Todd","p":"/6IUQyy2pA8PRXX1MEx088JH6pcu.jpg"},{"n":"Ryan Morgan","ch":"Wiz","p":"/zogTGGsLvQCxvuwkyOtwtbKAz3o.jpg"},{"n":"Laura 